WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.379
Start with nine. Take one from four to complete ten.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.589
Nine plus four becomes ten plus three.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.827
Ten plus three is thirteen. So nine plus four is thirteen.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.473
For subtraction, sixteen minus five is eleven.
